# Environment Variables

## What you need: ONLY the publishable (anon) key
The secret/service_role key is NOT used anywhere in this project. The
record-event edge function runs on the anon key with Row-Level Security
(anon can INSERT, cannot SELECT). Never put the service_role key in a
client `.env` or in Vercel — it bypasses RLS.

## Local development (.env at repo root)
# From Supabase → Project Settings → API (or "publishable keys" for new projects)
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...anon-or-publishable-key

## Vercel (Project → Settings → Environment Variables)
# Set BOTH of these for Production AND Preview environments:
#   PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL      = https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
#   PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = eyJ...anon-or-publishable-key
# (No secret/service_role key. Nothing else is needed.)

## Supabase edge function env
# None to set manually: SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are injected
# automatically into deployed edge functions.